## Interface: 11200
## Title: Valuator
## Notes: Adds vendor sell value and (with aux-addon) auction value to item tooltips everywhere - bags, bank, loot, trade, mail, merchant, auction house, tradeskill, quest rewards - in one consistent coin-icon format instead of each source addon's own style, with per-item and total breakdowns for stacks. Requires ShaguTweaks.
## Version: 1.0.0
## RequiredDep: ShaguTweaks
## OptionalDeps: aux-addon
## LoadOnDemand: 0
## Author: OddZealot
Valuator.lua
